WEBVTT

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.750
Jeez. Dinner's not even ready yet...

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.080
I'm sorry.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.330
Just thinking about how you're doing your best
to cook a meal for my sake... I couldn't help it.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.630
Sensei...

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.790
Do you smell something burning?

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.670
Huh?!

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.250
Oh no!

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.790
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.790
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:45.950
Utsukushiku are

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:45.950
Be beautiful

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.910
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.910
No Destiny, unworthy

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.870
Konnanja kitto monotarinai

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.870
If it's like this, then probably things will go well

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.960
You okay...?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.960
Did something happen...?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.960
I'll...

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.960
Be waiting for you...

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.700
Kurai katattokeba umaku iku

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.700
If we just talk as if it's never enough

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.950
Mono, kane, ai, koto,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.950
Things, money, love, words,

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.700
Mou jikokenji akita

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.700
I'm tired of self-asserting myself already

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.830
I got here before you.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.830
I have the correct meeting place, right?

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.830
Did something happen? You okay?

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.910
Déjà vu nani ga sonna fuman nanda?

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.910
Déjà vu, what are you so unsatisfied about?

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:13.660
Sanzan wagamama katattoite

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:13.660
You've said all sorts of selfish things,

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.580
Kore ijou hoka ni nani ga iru?

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.580
what more could you possibly want?

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.370
Sonna tokoro mo warito kirai ja nai

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.370
I kind of don't mind that about you

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.000
Mou "kiki akitanda yo sono serifu"

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.000
Honestly, "I'm sick of hearing that line"

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.790
Chuuto hanpa dake ha iya

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.790
The one thing I don't want is ambiguousness

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.540
Mou ii aa shite kou shite ittetatte

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.540
Enough. Even if you say to do this or that,

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.410
Aishite doushite? iwaretatte

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.410
Even if you say love me, or why?

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.200
Asobi dakenara kantan de

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.200
It's easy if it's just for fun

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.000
Shinken koushou muchakucha de

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.000
And that it's reckless serious negotiating

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.330
Omoi mo shinai omoi kotoba

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.330
How many times are those worn out unexpectedly

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:44.410
Nando tsukai furusu noka?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:44.410
Serious words going to be used?

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.500
Douse kitai shitetanda deki race demo

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.500
We were hoping anyway, even if it was a fixed race,

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.120
Inyou darake no phrase mo

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.120
Even all those quoted phrases,

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.750
Kakato mochiagaru kotoba taboo ni shite

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.750
Making backtracking words taboo

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.870
Kuuki wo yonda ame furanaide yo

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.870
Take a hint, don't let it rain

00:01:55.130 --> 00:02:00.630
Domestic Girlfriend

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.420
Courage! What makes a king out of a slave?

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:11.580
Courage! What makes the flag on the mast to wave?

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.540
Courage!

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:16.420
Akamori\h\h\h
High School

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.630
Welcome!

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.380
Literature Club

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.380
A café where

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.380
you can read books

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.220
Literature Club -
Club Publication

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.340
LITERATURE CLUB ANTHOLOGY

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.340
"GARDEN OF LIGHT"

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.330
This is well done, if I do say so myself...
Better than expected, you know?

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:28.380
Wouldn't it be good if we can keep this pace up
and start discussing the next club publication soon?

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.170
But Kiriya-sensei is absent again today, right?

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:34.750
Yeah... All I've heard is that he's not feeling well,

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.830
but he's already taken three days off,
so it's concerning, isn't it?

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:41.670
Well, I'm not sure... Isn't it normal if he's
just been absent for three days?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.460
You think so...?

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:47.630
I imagine that school teachers
usually don't take a lot of absences...

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.380
Well... do we want to go visit him or something?

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:58.630
Huh?!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.920
This is Kiriya-sensei's place...? For real?!

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.580
Um... his students?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.830
Uh, um, yes...

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:18.750
Come on in.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.500
Sensei's in the middle of working,
so please wait a little while.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.000
H-hey, is she Sensei's wife?

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.040
Huh? I heard that he's single.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.580
Then, his girlfriend?

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Since she's calling him "Sensei,"
maybe a former student or something...?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.330
Finally done...

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:45.960
Thank you for your hard work!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.210
I'm sorry to get this to you so late...

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:52.210
No, you're fine. We're all squared away now!
Anyway, I should get going.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.500
I'm exhausted...

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.080
I never expected that you guys would come to visit...

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.500
So, what brings you here?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.080
We're sorry for coming unannounced...

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.250
We came to check up on you.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.580
We were worried, Sensei,
due to your apparent continued absences.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.880
So that's what this is about.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.670
Then I have caused you trouble.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.130
Is your illness that bad...?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:24.580
The reason for me not feeling well is simply
from lack of sleep. So don't let it bother you.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.790
You see, I was struggling a little
to meet a deadline for work.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.290
"Work"...? As in for school?

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.920
By the way, who was that woman earlier...?

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.000
She is an editor.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.250
E-edit...?

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.380
I also do work writing novels.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.710
Huh?!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.830
What?! Writing novels?! A novelist?!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.830
Yes. Although I haven't disclosed that to the school.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.630
H-have you published any books?!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.330
Yes, about twelve of them.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:55.880
What's your pen name?!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.750
You Hasukawa.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.580
Y-You... Hasukawa...?

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.210
Would you let go of me, please?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.790
Hasu...kawa...
Sorry, he's a huge fan, apparently.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.250
Hasukawa...
I guess he did mention that before.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.170
I guess he did mention that before.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.130
Hasukawa...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.080
Oh, that reminds me...

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:17.210
While we're on the subject, let me ask you something.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.540
Regarding the stories from the club publication
that were sold at the school cultural festival,

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.000
do you have any interest in entering them for an award?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.040
Award...?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.830
An award for new writers. For novels.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:32.250
The literary magazine that I'm serialized in
is advertising right now for works from new writers.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.830
Your works were of good quality and so
I was thinking that you might want to enter them.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.250
If you win the award, it'll of course
be a shortcut towards going pro,

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.960
and for those of you not aiming for that,

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.790
I think it'd be a plus for things
like advancing in higher education or employment.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.670
Me... a pro...?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.670
I don't care one way or the other...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.420
I would really appreciate it!

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:57.040
Morning!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:57.920
Hi!

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.830
I feel like I'm dreaming.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.460
You mean the award?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:06.420
That too, but also the fact that an author I admire
has been close to me all this time.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.000
Ashihara-san! Morning!

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:17.920
Because of the shocking truth that came out,
I couldn't really get to sleep last night.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.000
Me neither.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.830
Aren't you glad that the woman from yesterday
wasn't his girlfriend or anything?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.380
Huh? Wh-why...?

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.330
You looked pale while we were waiting for Sensei.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:30.330
But you were all smiles when we left.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.290
Th-that's not...

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.710
You SO were!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.210
Come on, stop that, Fujii-kun!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.630
Natsuo-kun, you okay?!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.920
It kinda snapped and...

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.710
You broke it?!

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:56.710
I fell down the stairs, so...

00:07:56.710 --> 00:08:00.380
Technically speaking, it's just a hairline fracture.
So they say it's not a big deal.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.630
Still...

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.130
Well, I'm gonna get dinner ready.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.130
Hina-nee, are you staying over tonight?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.250
I've got to prepare for tomorrow's classes,
so I'll go home tonight...

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.170
I'm sorry for making you worry when you're busy.

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:21.210
With this leg, I might not be able
to go to your place like I used to, Sensei.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:23.750
It's fine. It's okay. Don't overdo it.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.830
But... I'm a little sad.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.290
I'm a little sad, too...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.790
But it's more important for your body to heal, Natsuo-kun.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.170
Okay?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.830
Okay...

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.880
Thanks for dinner.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.750
Um...

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.790
It's kinda hard to eat if you keep staring at me...

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.170
Whoa! Don't lie on it!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:58.630
I'm a little... happy that you broke your leg.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.130
Huh?! Hap...? How can you say that?!

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:05.460
It hurts and it's hard to move around.
It's been pretty crappy, you know!

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.210
How can you say you're happy abou-

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:19.000
Well, you've been going to Fumiya-kun's house a lot
lately, so you're not eating at home much, you know?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.330
With this, though, you'll have to rest at home
for a while, right?

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:29.420
I'll take good care of you until you heal
so that you don't get bored.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:42.630
Um... It's fine, really. Please get up, Ashihara-san...

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.790
Plus, everyone's kinda giving us looks...

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.750
I am really sorry!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:54.250
I know that apologizing doesn't make up for this!
And of course I will pay for your medical costs...!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:58.080
If there is anything that I can do,
please let me know! Okay?!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.500
Really, it's fine...

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:02.540
Natsuo, this is your chance. Use this as a pretext.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.040
Why don't you have her do
all kinds of things for you, ya know?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:05.920
Shut up.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.500
I can barely move and I only have one usable leg...

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.000
I'm exhausted after just one day.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:20.210
Whoa!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:23.250
Hey...! What're you coming in here for?!

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.040
At this point... you've already seen it before.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.380
Mom also asked me to help you out, anyway.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.210
With that leg, you probably can't even
wash your body properly, right?

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:38.710
Plus, it would suck for me if you got hurt again
or something while I'm here for you.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.290
Th-then...

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.210
Turn the lights off so that it's hard to see.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.790
Crap...

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:06.080
Sensei, don't get me wrong!
This is, like... beyond my control...

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.580
It's by no means cheating!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.670
You want me to wash your body now?

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.170
Huh? Sure...

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:29.330
Want me to do the front too? Like, your leg.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.920
It's fine! I'll do it myself.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:34.330
Then, I'll make more foam before that. Um...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.210
Body soap... Body soap...

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.130
Huh...?

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.170
Hey, by any chance-

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.130
Shut up!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.000
Café

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.000
L'AMANT

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.500
Well of course Natsuo-chan would've had a hard time!

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:59.080
But I really didn't mean to.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.460
Well, it's especially sensitive at times like that, so...

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.420
Boss...
Ba-dum tiss~!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.080
I finished the inventory check in the back!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.380
Oh, Fumiya-kun.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.000
You may have already heard from Natsuo,

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.420
but he broke his leg so he probably can't
go hang out at your place for a while.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.130
Huh?

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.290
It may get lonely for you
since he's been going over a lot lately, but...

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.830
Lately?

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.830
Natsuo hasn't been over to my house
in quite a while, you know?

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.420
I'm home...

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.130
Hey, welcome home.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:32.000
Huh? Where's Mom and Fujii-san?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:32.960
Shopping.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.500
Wh-what...?

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.580
You know, I stopped by L'Amant today.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:55.540
And it sounds like you haven't been
to Fumiya-kun's house for a while now.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.330
Where'd you go every time?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.040
Why were you lying?

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.170
Actually, the thing is...

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.540
I've been going to Momo's place.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.380
Momo...?

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:17.080
Ah, well... ever since I went there once,
I've been getting invited frequently and...

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:21.580
Oh, but... I thought you might get into
a bad mood again if I told you that, so...

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.080
It's not like I'm getting into a bad mood or anything.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.210
Then what's with that angry, pouty look?

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.880
Even still, it would've been fine if you'd just told me.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.790
It makes me feel worse that you lied to me.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:39.420
Besides, do you realize that if you go
to Momo's place, I end up eating dinner by myself?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.880
Next time you get invited, let me know, too.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.290
I got it... Sorry.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.630
Make sure to tell me about stuff like that
beforehand, you know?

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.170
I seriously panicked because I thought
I might've said something I shouldn't have!

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.630
Sorry, sorry.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.380
Anyway... it's like the improbable of improbable.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:04.420
You know, that your first love came true.
I thought you'd have no choice but to give up.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.170
But, will things be okay?

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:08.000
What do you mean?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.080
When one thinks about Hina-sensei's position
and relation to you,

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.920
it's gonna be really bad if you guys are found out.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:13.790
There's also the futu-

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.130
I'll make sure we're not found out!
Things are totally under control!

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.920
Okay! Okay!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:22.830
Besides, I am, in my own way,
thinking about the future, you know?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:28.080
Somehow find a way to be with Sensei
and to work hard to become an author and...

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.250
I will definitely make Sensei happy.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:38.040
Well, I'll just put a curse on you so that you
step in dog shit while on a date or something.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.630
What's up with that...?

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.210
Book Room

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.710
I wanna see her... And she's so cute...

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.790
You're already here. You're early.

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:59.040
Uh, hey, about today... I'm gonna go
to Fumiya's house on the way home.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.330
For real...?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:07.540
H-honest... I thought I should go apologize
for using Fumiya's name to lie.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:12.540
I see. Make sure to apologize properly then, okay?

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.580
We're still in the middle of eating...

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.170
I'm sorry. I just couldn't help it.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.290
Jeez...

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:31.920
Ish good.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:33.460
I'm glad!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.250
Oh, by the way, how are you getting by at home?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.960
It seems like it'd be hard with the stairs
or taking a bath and stuff.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:42.290
Uh, I still stumble a bit, but...
Well, I'm getting by somehow.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.080
Ash for baffs...

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:53.540
Sensei, if you were living with me,
would you help me with taking baths?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:55.210
As in taking them together?!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.080
Uh...

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.960
Sure. If it's to make sure you don't get hurt, Natsuo-kun...

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:10.040
Really? Just that answer itself totally makes me happy...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.040
About the bath...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.460
Maybe I'll just take one here.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.500
What?! If you did something like that, you'd be found out!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.080
It'll be fine as long as I take another bath
right when I get home.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.580
Is that a no?

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.080
Come on, Sensei.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.080
Oh, fine! I give in!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:41.460
You know, just because you're injured... Not fair...

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:05.170
Actually, the bath can wait... So, can we?

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:07.920
Natsuo-kun...

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.420
It might be a delivery...

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.380
Coming!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:39.290
In an empty place in my heart, it was quietly locked away

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.580
Thank you for...

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.710
Rui...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:46.920
A fragile fleeting fragment of desire;

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.040
Rui...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:53.080
It breaks down without making a sound

00:17:54.170 --> 00:18:00.000
If it's going to hurt this much,

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:06.580
It would've been better not knowing

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:05.420
Hey... Um...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:13.960
That kindness is, that warmth is,

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:21.080
At times, it's too cruel that,

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:32.040
It's painful and sad and this desire could crush me

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.880
Rui! Rui, wait!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:41.830
I couldn't stop the overflowing tears and I was trembling

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:51.630
Too close and too far and I couldn't realize your feelings

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:45.630
When you were coming here, what did you say to Rui...?

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:50.830
Fumiya... I said I was going to a friend's house.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:19:02.500
I was having a fleeting dream, of a dream that will never come true

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.540
Welcome home!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.130
I'm back... Where's Rui?

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:15.670
I got home just now, but she wasn't here.
Maybe she went to the supermarket?

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:19.750
Hello?!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.540
Hey, Natsuo? It's me.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:26.420
Rui-chan came to my house today, you know?
She came to pick you up since it started raining.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:29.040
You got caught in a lie again... You sure things are okay?

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:34.000
Just in case, I did tell her that you'd already left,
but she was really worried, you know?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.960
Sorry...

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.750
Liar...

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:11.210
Sorry...

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:24.710
Why are you covered in so much mud?
You were using an umbrella.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.670
Oh... Well...

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.670
I didn't have good balance
since I had an umbrella and a crutch.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:35.420
Are you stupid? To go out in this rain with that leg...

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:40.210
Since I didn't know where you went,
I looked everywhere for you.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:45.250
With hills and stairs and stuff, it's not all flat streets,
so it's not like I had a choice.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:49.380
Then you really are stupid.
You could've just left me alone.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.880
I heard over the phone earlier.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.960
You actually came to pick me up at Fumiya's house?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.580
Because I believed your story...

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:03.040
Then... why'd you think that I'd be at Sensei's place?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:07.630
When I got home you still hadn't gotten back, so...

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:12.750
Even when I called, you didn't answer.
I thought that something might've happened.

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:14.710
So then...

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.920
When I went into your room
to see if I could find some kind of clue...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:26.130
I ended up reading that novel that you'd written before.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:35.750
A story about a student who falls in love with a teacher
at school... And that teacher has a boyfriend...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:40.750
I read that and everything that had been
bothering me up until now connected.

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:46.540
And that if you were at Hina-nee's place,
there'd be no mistake...

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.500
Are you... in love with Hina-nee...?

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:01.710
Yeah...

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:06.670
I've been in love with Sensei... for a long time now...

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:16.580
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:16.580
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.330
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:28.920
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:28.920
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:38.500
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:38.500
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:47.380
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:47.380
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:55.670
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:55.670
The easiest things become harder to do

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:59.630
Otona ni nareba

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:59.630
If I become an adult,

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:12.130
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:12.130
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:17.380
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:17.380
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:21.580
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:21.580
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:26.130
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:26.130
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:30.630
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:30.630
I can't stand it more

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:36.080
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:36.080
Don't look that way

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:42.420
Episode 11

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:42.420
Are you sure?

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:39.830
"Are you sure?"
